  aciklama:
  - "Fincan\u0131n dibine do\u011Fru, \xFCzerine telve topaklar\u0131 y\u0131\u011F\u0131lm\u0131\u015F
    bir \"ke\xE7i\" fig\xFCr\xFC g\xF6r\xFCyorum {{isim}}. Bu ke\xE7i, kald\u0131rabilece\u011Finin
    \xE7ok \xFCst\xFCnde bir y\xFCk s\u0131rtlanm\u0131\u015F; daha do\u011Frusu
    ta\u015F\u0131d\u0131\u011F\u0131 y\xFCk, \xFCzerine ba\u015Fkalar\u0131 taraf\u0131ndan
    ac\u0131mas\u0131zca y\xFCklenmi\u015F. Anlad\u0131\u011F\u0131m kadar\u0131yla,
    etraf\u0131nda hatalar\u0131yla y\xFCzle\u015Femeyen ve kabahatini, kafas\u0131nda
    \u015Fekillendirdi\u011Fi bir \"g\xFCnah ke\xE7isine\" y\xFCklemeye al\u0131\u015Fm\u0131\u015F
    insanlar var. Haks\u0131z birtak\u0131m ithamlar\u0131n sana y\xF6neltilmesinin
    sebebi, {{kelime, seni \xE7ekemiyor olu\u015Flar\u0131 | onlar\u0131n uzanamad\u0131klar\u0131
    \u015Feylere sahip olman | onlar\u0131n hayalini dahi kuramad\u0131klar\u0131
    \u015Feylere sahip olman}}.\n\nSeni rahats\u0131z eden bu hususta, haks\u0131zl\u0131k
    yapt\u0131\u011F\u0131n\u0131 d\xFC\u015F\xFCnd\xFC\u011F\xFCn bir {{kelime,
    han\u0131mefendiden | beyefendiden}} \xF6n\xFCm\xFCzdeki {{ay_2}} ay\u0131n\u0131n
    {{kelime, son g\xFCnlerinde | ikinci \xE7eyre\u011Fi i\xE7erisinde | \xFC\xE7\xFCnc\xFC
    \xE7eyre\u011Fi i\xE7erisinde | ikinci yar\u0131s\u0131nda | 10'u ile 20'si aras\u0131nda
    | 5'i ile 15'i aras\u0131ndaki hafta sonunda}} {{kelime, adeta \xF6\xE7 alacaks\u0131n
    | hakk\u0131n\u0131 alacaks\u0131n | hesap soracaks\u0131n}}. Bu durum, seni
    bir ku\u015F gibi hafifletecek."
